                                        "processed": "\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\u0022subhead color-accent\u0022\u003ELocal \u0026amp; Creative\u003C\/span\u003E\u003C\/p\u003E\n\u003Ch1\u003EMacDonalDesign\u003C\/h1\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EA fully custom digital ecosystem built with headless Drupal 11, Next.js, and automated CI\/CD. The platform combines modern frontend architecture, API-driven content, GitHub integration, and Jenkins deployments into a scalable development workflow.\u003C\/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Ca class=\u0022button transparent\u0022 href=\u0022https:\/\/smmacdonald.github.io\u0022 target=\u0022_blank\u0022 tabindex=\u00220\u0022\u003EView Website\u003C\/a\u003E\u003C\/p\u003E\n"
