                                        "body": {
                                            "processed": "\u003Cp class=\u0022text-align-center\u0022\u003E\u003Cspan class=\u0022subhead color-accent\u0022\u003ECASE STUDY\u003C\/span\u003E\u003C\/p\u003E\n\u003Cp class=\u0022text-align-center\u0022\u003E\u003Cspan class=\u0022h3\u0022\u003EChallenge\u003C\/span\u003E\u003C\/p\u003E\n\u003Cp class=\u0022text-align-center\u0022\u003EThe goal was to build more than a traditional portfolio website. I wanted the site itself to demonstrate modern web development, API-driven architecture, version control, automation, and CI\/CD practices while remaining flexible enough to evolve as new projects and technologies were added.\u003C\/p\u003E\n"
