                                        "verticalAlign": true,
                                        "body": {
                                            "processed": "\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\u0022subhead color-accent\u0022\u003EPHASE 1 SOLUTION\u003C\/span\u003E\u003C\/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\u0022h3\u0022\u003EModern Drupal Platform\u003C\/span\u003E\u003C\/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\n\u003Cli data-list-item-id=\u0022e14325da0ea3ef791610c9b22f19517b5\u0022\u003EBuilt a custom Drupal 11 website as the content management platform.\u003C\/li\u003E\n\u003Cli data-list-item-id=\u0022eeea1ae9a4363f182b0d1f9f0e9042ad7\u0022\u003EStructured portfolio projects, experience, skills, and other content in Drupal.\u003C\/li\u003E\n\u003Cli data-list-item-id=\u0022eedd96273d33d5b9e5e2748b28f0cd0c0\u0022\u003EDeveloped a custom content architecture designed to support a headless implementation.\u003C\/li\u003E\n\u003Cli data-list-item-id=\u0022efc9ae0b3aedfa5c8379bc0ea06893c86\u0022\u003EUsed Git and GitHub for source control and version management.\u003C\/li\u003E\n\u003Cli data-list-item-id=\u0022e10dea5fa713166e353d9583bb56eb854\u0022\u003EBuilt reusable Drupal components and custom functionality rather than relying entirely on contributed modules.\u003C\/li\u003E\n\u003C\/ul\u003E\n"
