                                        "verticalAlign": true,
                                        "body": {
                                            "processed": "\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\u0022subhead color-accent\u0022\u003EPHASE 2 SOLUTION\u003C\/span\u003E\u003C\/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\u0022h3\u0022\u003EHeadless Next.js Application\u003C\/span\u003E\u003C\/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\n\u003Cli data-list-item-id=\u0022e8c19bdc0643eb173ab66c3da11dbfe15\u0022\u003EDeveloped a Next.js front end using TypeScript and modern React architecture.\u003C\/li\u003E\n\u003Cli data-list-item-id=\u0022e266104edb158b00364efe853b17d3476\u0022\u003EImplemented a headless Drupal architecture using REST API and GraphQL to retrieve content from Drupal.\u003C\/li\u003E\n\u003Cli data-list-item-id=\u0022e187a5080f20b3566472e25b102119f3d\u0022\u003ESeparated the content management layer from the presentation layer, allowing the front end and Drupal platform to evolve independently.\u003C\/li\u003E\n\u003Cli data-list-item-id=\u0022e82214da8d47e23074d2c30b52f22a13e\u0022\u003EBuilt responsive, reusable UI components with a focus on performance, accessibility, and maintainability.\u003C\/li\u003E\n\u003Cli data-list-item-id=\u0022ea843cd76c8893e5c1cefa8693825e1e8\u0022\u003EUsed Node.js, NPM, and modern front-end development tooling to manage the application and build process.\u003C\/li\u003E\n\u003C\/ul\u003E\n"
                                        }
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
