                                        "id": "270",
                                        "verticalAlign": true,
                                        "body": {
                                            "processed": "\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\u0022subhead color-accent\u0022\u003EPHASE 3 SOLUTION\u003C\/span\u003E\u003C\/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\u0022h3\u0022\u003ECI\/CD \u0026amp; Deployment Automation\u003C\/span\u003E\u003C\/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\n\u003Cli data-list-item-id=\u0022e90faeeed3d2241fc7fec39a37c1855dc\u0022\u003EBuilt automated Jenkins CI\/CD pipelines for development and production deployments.\u003C\/li\u003E\n\u003Cli data-list-item-id=\u0022e951d2d2690d0e66c3ab8093955264f19\u0022\u003EIntegrated GitHub Actions into the development workflow for automated processes and repository-level tasks.\u003C\/li\u003E\n\u003Cli data-list-item-id=\u0022e51e6400efd5be211a9cf130bc9ab5f30\u0022\u003EImplemented Git-based deployment workflows using separate development and production branches.\u003C\/li\u003E\n\u003Cli data-list-item-id=\u0022e61bd9fd4d860e6a9e86e60c5a6db246d\u0022\u003ECreated automated production release tagging and immutable release builds.\u003C\/li\u003E\n\u003Cli data-list-item-id=\u0022e4510a6f5a1f82f17d22cd27fc8175209\u0022\u003EBuilt deployment scripts that package application code into versioned build artifacts and deploy them to the appropriate environment.\u003C\/li\u003E\n\u003Cli data-list-item-id=\u0022e0739ab08a2fd6144f10f1a5707258c8c\u0022\u003EImplemented automated Drupal deployment tasks including database updates, configuration imports, cache rebuilding, and cleanup of previous releases.\u003C\/li\u003E\n\u003Cli data-list-item-id=\u0022ebff42959867b531cc2fba6cad85402f9\u0022\u003EDesigned a release-based deployment architecture with shared files and configuration separated from application code.\u003C\/li\u003E\n\u003Cli data-list-item-id=\u0022e15d56b4af8027a968c3a8fb48886e504\u0022\u003EAdded automated deployment verification and failure-stage tracking to improve pipeline visibility and troubleshooting.\u003C\/li\u003E\n\u003C\/ul\u003E\n"
                                        }
